  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-31T12:50:59.354Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please fix or change how players find worlds. VRChat is burring good worlds and routing people to the same boring places. Some of us are spending weeks working on custom stuff only to be burred by places like the \"presentation room\". Why is this a thing? Why are portals in prime locations in the hub sending people back to the hub? I'm not understanding the design choice behind a lot of this. Additionally where is the bar on worlds being made public? I've seen a public world with single avatar in it.",
